## Module 11: Inventory / PIM
**Total Pages**: 23

### Scenarios & Use Cases
1. **Item Master Data**:
   - Navigate to `Item Directory` & `Item Profile`.
   - Check `Item Master Org Tabs` (Purchasing, BOM, Costing).
   - Use `Item Category Hierarchy` tree.
   - View `Item Relationships`.
2. **Stock Operations**:
   - View [Inventory](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/scm.ts#162-163) list and `OnHandBalanceInquiry`.
