   - Review `MinMaxPlanningSetup`.
3. **Advanced Inventory**:
   - Check `LotSerialManager` genealogy.
   - Execute a `CycleCountingAudit`.
   - View `MaterialStatusControls`.
   - Verify `UOMConversionMatrix`.
   - Check `ConsignmentStockManager` billing triggers.
   - Configure [LocatorPickingSequence](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/scm/wms/LocatorPickingSequence.tsx#48-193) (Zone/Class rules).
   - Setup `ABCClassificationSetup`.
   - Test `CatchWeightEntry`.

